    {"symbol": "🔢", "tooltip": "A compute threshold a court can verify is a gate a lobbyist cannot negotiate."},
    {"symbol": "🏚️", "tooltip": "A dissolved deployer is a defendant with no assets to seize — liability finds nothing where ex-ante gating would have caught the leak."}
  ],
